{"id": "DfY4JoBxCAR", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Bachpan mein Baapu ke kandhe pe baith ke duniya dekhi thi… tab se bas ek hi sapna tha: ek din unhe apne kandhon jitna uncha dikhaun. 🥹\n\nMele ke jhoole ke neeche, unke kandhe pe pehli baar aasmaan chhua.\nDarwaze ki chaukhat pe har saal ek nayi lakeer… aur Baapu chupke se muskura dete.\nPhir Canada ki barfeeli raatein, truck ka steering, aur visor mein unki chhoti si photo.\nGhar lauta toh darwaza khulte hi wahi aankhein mili, jo saalon se raah dekh rahi thi.\nAaj unke kandhe ki bori maine utha li hai… aur usi mele ke jhoole ki sabse oonchi jagah se, duniya main unhe dikha raha hoon. 🎡\n\nSidhu Moose Wala da “Baapu” sirf ek Punjabi song nahi, har us putt di dil di gal hai jo apne Baapu da sir uchcha karna chahunda hai. Baap-putt da pyaar, Sidhu di awaaz vich. Legends never die 🤍\n\n🎵 Baapu · Sidhu Moose Wala (Yes I Am Student)\n\nApne Baapu nu bhejo… ya us yaar nu jo ghar ton door, ghar layi kamaun gaya hai 🤍\n\n#sidhumoosewala #baapu #punjabisong", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793943685, "like_count": 4373, "comment_count": 19, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2179429309327034a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.771, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPR12Bj7VZhid6n-SFlsKwQR1vKUQUmZ1fVuLvbJWM6uLlPjWCBGeiJLqxQRdXrEE1HTbW1CmwMOQauU-dRQEwxzfPGJAFtgpX-90M.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Adrc14t4IDf6tw6s9DUBngqfNElv8Ri6HXLiqnHS_k7D3dGPgx1ICwf_tNrP38YzEoHQzoU11J-XPvsIRd5U37hj&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=hwgNc9SOugAQ7kNvwHMx3YP&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=X-Ps9Al8FWRCzlKaUpNx8w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQR8KGkxNfEXML8yMv244I1GyUI6JhuWwc2q3vYqpf8J6A&oe=6AF4306E", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods":